    given-names: Lauben
    affiliation: "Makerere University"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mpairwe7/OptiscanAI"
abstract: >-
  Offline-first, multi-label retinal disease classification (45 diseases) built
  on a RETFound/LoRA hybrid model with clinical knowledge-graph reasoning, a
  FastAPI backend, and a Next.js frontend — designed for clinical screening in
  low-resource settings.
keywords:
  - retinal-imaging
  - medical-ai
  - multi-label-classification
  - mlops
  - global-health
